{
  "suite": "manual-synthetic-v1",
  "notes": "Synthetic texts with expectations fixed before live inference. Exact typed spans; nested PERSON name parts explicitly allowed. Invalid checksums/calendar values are deliberate negative controls, not a claim about whether mistyped data is sensitive. IP expected absent for the default profile.",
